{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Thanks for the meal, I'll come again."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Okay, okaaay, be good to your <STYLE ID="2">girlfriend</STYLE> nooow."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The old woman saw us off cheerfully to the very end.
